62
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:03,770
Dépêche-toi. On ne peut pas commencer sans toi.

63
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:05,020
D'accord.

64
00:03:08,350 --> 00:03:10,810
Le cahier... Le cahier ?

65
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,900
Le cahier, c'est-à-dire...

66
00:03:14,530 --> 00:03:15,610
Le cahier !

67
00:03:16,030 --> 00:03:16,860
Roberto !?

68
00:03:18,150 --> 00:03:20,240
C'- C'est impossible !

69
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,370
Roberto...

